Cats Tutorial

  This tutorial demonstrates using {{{https://typelevel.org/cats-effect/}Cats Effect}} within a
  Spring Boot application.

  The application retrieves a message from an H2 database using
  {{{https://tpolecat.github.io/doobie/}doobie}} and returns it in an HTTP response.

  {{{https://github.com/officefloor/OfficeFloor/tree/master/tutorials/springboot/SpringRestCatsHttpServer}Tutorial Source}}



